# Valley of AI — Production Environment Variables (for Vercel)
# 
# Copy these values to your Vercel project:
# 1. Go to https://vercel.com/dashboard
# 2. Select your "valley-of-ai" project
# 3. Click "Settings" > "Environment Variables"
# 4. Add each variable below with its value (leave NEXT_PUBLIC prefix)
#
# ============================================================================

# === SUPABASE (Required for vote functionality) ===
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard
# - URL: Project Settings > API > Project URL
# - Anon Key: Project Settings > API > Project API keys > anonKey
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://yourproject.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# === EMAILJS (Required for contact form on /suggest page) ===
# Get these from: https://www.emailjs.com/
# - Service ID: Dashboard > Services > Copy Service ID
# - Template ID: Dashboard > Email Templates > Copy Template ID
# - Public Key: Dashboard > Account > API Keys > Copy Public Key
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# === CLOUDFLARE TURNSTILE (Required for bot protection on /suggest page) ===
# Get these from: https://dash.cloudflare.com/
# - Site Key: Turnstile > Sites > Copy Site Key
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=your_site_key_here_0x...

# === GOOGLE ANALYTICS (Optional) ===
# Get this from: https://analytics.google.com/
# - Measurement ID: Admin > Data Streams > Web > Measurement ID
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# === SITE CONFIG (These are the same for production) ===
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Valley of AI
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAIN_SITE_URL=https://www.valleyofai.com

# === SOCIAL LINKS (Optional - can match .env.example) ===
NEXT_PUBLIC_TWITTER_URL=https://twitter.com/...
NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_URL=https://github.com/...
NEXT_PUBLIC_DISCORD_URL=https://discord.gg/...
NEXT_PUBLIC_THREADS_URL=https://threads.net/...
NEXT_PUBLIC_TIKTOK_URL=https://www.tiktok.com/...

# ============================================================================
# HOW TO ADD THESE TO VERCEL:
# 
# Option 1: Via Vercel Dashboard (UI)
#   1. Go to https://vercel.com/dashboard
#   2. Click your "valley-of-ai" project
#   3. Go to Settings tab > Environment Variables
#   4. Click "Add New" for each variable below
#   5. Paste the key name and value, select "Production" for Environment
#   6. Redeploy your project (or wait for next push to main)
#
# Option 2: Via Vercel CLI
#   1. Install Vercel CLI: npm i -g vercel
#   2. Link your project: vercel link
#   3. Add variables: vercel env add (interactive)
#   4. Pull into local .env.local: vercel env pull
#   5. Push to Vercel: git push origin main
#
# Option 3: Script (paste each line into Vercel dashboard)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=<your-url>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-key>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=<your-id>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=<your-id>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=<your-key>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=<your-key>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Valley of AI
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_MAIN_SITE_URL=https://www.valleyofai.com
#
# ============================================================================
# NOTES:
# 
# - All NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are safe to expose (they're in client bundles)
# - Don't commit actual credentials to git
# - Restart Vercel deployment after adding env vars for changes to take effect
# - You can test locally with these values in .env.local before deploying
# ============================================================================
